xcited to know about Bitcoin  but needed clarification about how  Bitcoin can solve such issues that large  institutions like Banks cannot  Jack further explained that Bitcoin is a  transparent Ledger without a central  Authority and works on blockchain  technology  blockchain is a system for storing data  in a way that makes it challenging or  impossible to alter hack or defraud the  system  a blockchain is simply a network of  computer systems that maintains  duplicate copies of all transactions in  a digital Ledger disseminated throughout  the network  and BTC is the currency used to make  those transactions successful and as  there are no middlemen the transaction  cost is way cheaper as each system in  the network carries a copy of The Ledger  or transaction stored in it making it  impossible to hack or manipulate because  to do so you will have to take down or  hack every system or node participating  in the network  Bitcoin is completely digital  Jordan after knowing this asked how it  could solve his problem and how he could  get access to bitcoin if it's completely  digital  Jack explained that one can always buy  Bitcoins once you own Bitcoin it gives  you a specific ID which gives you full  control over your money using that ID  you can send or receive funds in your  Bitcoin account that can be later  converted into any currency anytime you  want so if he would have invested that  same amount in Bitcoin years ago he  could have easily accessed it and it  would have been worth much more than  they were years ago  another reference is a Vignesh  sundarisan famously known as medicovan  who became a billionaire with just five  thousand dollars investment all because  of Bitcoin  so these examples are powerful enough to  establish the fact that Bitcoin is the  best alternative for today's Financial  establishment and also how bright its  future is going to be  well here's a question for you where are  all the Bitcoin transactions stored a  blockchain b digital